    "created_at": "2017-01-17T07:19:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-17T07:19:55Z",
    "body": "Yeah, notifying after the DOM operation completes is safe. Last time this came up though implementers were somewhat worried about performance if we gave the option to get after-operation notifications.",
